      <cyrillic>дөтчилөх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DØTECILE-</transcript>
      <definition>[= døtycile-] v.t. and i. To take a snort cut; to consider near or close.</definition>
      <page>269</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠥᠲᠠᠴᠢᠯᠠᠨ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n jabuxu</transcript>
          <definition> To go by the shortest road.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
